msgid "[big]Set your password[/big]\n\nYour account has been successfully activated. Please set your password to complete your registration.\n\nClick the link below to create your password. After that, you can sign in and start using all features.\n\nGood luck and enjoy using the classifieds!"
msgstr "[big]Set your password[/big]\n\nYour account has been successfully activated. Please set your password to complete your registration.\n\nClick the link below to create your password. After that, you can sign in and start using all features.\n\nGood luck and enjoy using the classifieds!"

msgid "Mandatory intro text shown below the mail logo (if present) and above the existing set-password mail content. Plain text only. Use [bold]...[/bold] for bold text and [big]...[/big] for a large bold headline. Real blank lines are preserved. Leave the field empty to use the translated default text from the language files."
msgstr "Mandatory intro text shown below the mail logo (if present) and above the existing set-password mail content. Plain text only. Use [bold]...[/bold] for bold text and [big]...[/big] for a large bold headline. Real blank lines are preserved. Leave the field empty to use the translated default text from the language files."

msgid "User set password e-mail"
msgstr "User set password e-mail"

msgid "[big]Welcome to the classifieds[/big]\n\nYour new account only needs to be confirmed now. After that, you can use all features and contact listing owners. Please click the confirmation link further below to activate your account. Then sign in with your details... and off you go.\n\nGood luck with the classifieds."
msgstr "[big]Welcome to the classifieds[/big]\n\nYour new account only needs to be confirmed now. After that, you can use all features and contact listing owners. Please click the confirmation link further below to activate your account. Then sign in with your details... and off you go.\n\nGood luck with the classifieds."


